# Social-post video, regenerated by `pnpm media` alongside the GIFs
docs/media/*.mp4

# The hand tracker's wasm and models — 35 MB of binaries, put here by
# `pnpm hands:setup`. The wasm is copied out of node_modules (it is already a
# declared dependency) and the two models are fetched once, pinned by digest in
# tools/hands-models.sha256, which IS committed. Vendored rather than fetched
# at page load so the page serves them from its own origin; not committed,
# because a library repo should not carry 35 MB of weights to clone. Not under
# `public/` either — Vite copies that into every build whether the page using
# it was built or not.
apps/editor/.hands/
